anity is an oddity.\n\nYou awake to find yourself a prisoner within a living nightmare. Your name, your past: gone, but not the record of your misdeeds. Your crimes: beyond comprehension. Your conviction: incontestable. Your sentence: eternal. The need to escape and set things right: undeniable.\n\nFight your way out of a living, twisting labyrinth. Hone your skills as you take on dynamic combat encounters and absurd puzzles. Meet the Cosmic Engine\u2019s most disturbing and grotesque inhabitants, all with unique and nonsensical personalities, who are just as likely to aid in your quest as they are to deceive you.\n\nEscape means freedom, and in freedom, the truth.", "summary": "Moroi is a grimdark fairytale with an even darker sense of humor. Experience frantic combat, perplexing puzzles, and a twisting narrative anchored by a bizarre cast of characters. Can you break free from eternal madness?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/moroi", "videos": [{"id": 141759, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "KRR0yLTNUis", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KRR0yLTNUis", "title": "Moroi - Official Next Fest Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KRR0yLTNUis/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 138091, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "PeXCOkKuZP0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PeXCOkKuZP0", "title": "Moroi | Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PeXCOkKuZP0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 143400, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "QLL8WzLNEcM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QLL8WzLNEcM", "title": "Moroi: Welcome to The Cosmic Engine", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QLL8WzLNEcM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 148840, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "AMjRymEJz18", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AMjRymEJz18", "title": "Moroi - Official Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AMjRymEJz18/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}